WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.440
For how long have you been working with us?

00:01.440 --> 00:04.560
We've been with Spark Marketing for about three months now.

00:04.560 --> 00:06.960
How much money have we brought in from our leads?

00:06.960 --> 00:10.240
In about three months we have about half a million dollars.

00:10.240 --> 00:11.680
Stop being skeptical.

00:11.680 --> 00:12.640
You need a team.

00:12.640 --> 00:16.480
You need people like Spark who are going to bring that lead to your table

00:16.480 --> 00:17.360
without Spark.

00:17.360 --> 00:21.840
We want to be in this position today where we are pushing one million in total sales

00:21.840 --> 00:24.240
and it's a blessing to be in this position right now.

